  {
   "id": "neverawake-192774@major-2023-03-30",
   "gameId": "neverawake-192774",
   "displayName": "【News!】NeverAwake for Xbox ＆ Update Schedule",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-30T07:02:28.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We hope you are having a wonderful nightmare today.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "From here in Japan, the cherry blossoms are in full bloom, we have new news to share with you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We made this announcement at The MIX,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The Xbox Series X|S version will be available!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We are currently working hard on the development of the game for release 😈.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "For those of you who own the Steam version, don't worry, we are planning to update it as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "More details on the schedule and updates will be forthcoming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "And we will inform you about the events in Japan as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We will also be exhibiting \"NeverAwake\" at Indie Games Connect on Sunday, April 30!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The location is Ginza, Tokyo, and admission is free!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If you are in Tokyo, please come and visit us!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "For more information, click here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We will be exhibiting the original rolling switch version of the game, which you can only play here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Also we will be preparing a small sticker for those who try out the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "▼Here's what the Rolling Switch version looks like",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": ".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The entire development team will continue to work hard to make the game even better,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you will continue to have a good nightmare!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
