  {
   "id": "neverawake-192774@1.1.0",
   "gameId": "neverawake-192774",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-01-18T15:07:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I hope you all have a wonderful nightmare today!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Major Update [Ver. 1.1.0] is available today!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We hope that everyone who has already seen the end of the story, as well as those who are just starting to play, will be pleased with this update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We think everyone will be happy with this update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "▼Update Contents",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "General balance adjustment to make the game easier to play.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added \"HIMITSU CHALLENGE\" for users who have completed World 8",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added highscore ranking",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added 6 new accessories",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed the performance of the score bag/compact mirror.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed TIPS for each stage so they can be checked from the MAIN MENU",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted auto-aim",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved performance and fixed minor bugs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Official Steam Deck support",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The long awaited \"HIMITSU CHALLENGE\" has been added to all stages of the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have also added new accessories, so please try different combinations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And for all the hardcore players out there, here it comes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The HIGH SCORE RANKING is finally here. And it's cross-platform!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We look forward to seeing your scores.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Finally, the PS5/PS4/Switch versions are now available!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The above updates are of course included in the consumer version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If you've already played the Steam version, we hope you'll take a look at how we've optimized the game for each platform.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Nintendo eShop : here",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "PlayStation Store: here",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "We also made a new trailer!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It focuses on the story of the game. Please take a look.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "So, continue to have a good nightmare!!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
